00:28:14,950 --> 00:28:18,520
我们的志愿者可以认出他们看到的所有水果,
our volunteers can name all the fruit that we show them,

523
00:28:18,520 --> 00:28:20,990
甚至是他们从没见过的。
even ones they've never seen before.

524
00:28:20,990 --> 00:28:22,690
做得好。他们全都正确。
Well done. That's all of them correct.

525
00:28:22,690 --> 00:28:24,120
恭喜。
Congratulations.

526
00:28:24,130 --> 00:28:28,430
这个实验中发生的正是语言的进化,
And what's happened here is that the language has evolved.

527
00:28:28,430 --> 00:28:31,100
它有着进化后的语言结构,
It has evolved structure,

528
00:28:31,100 --> 00:28:34,140
结果表明人们犯的错误
and it turns out that the mistakes people make

529
00:28:34,140 --> 00:28:36,940
会倾向于变成
will tend to be the kinds of things

530
00:28:36,940 --> 00:28:39,470
其他参与者可以学习的,
that other participants can learn,

531
00:28:39,470 --> 00:28:42,810
那么一代人犯的所有错,
so every mistake one generation makes

532
00:28:42,810 --> 00:28:46,650
使得语言对于下一代人更容易学习。
makes the language easier to learn for the next generation.

533
00:28:46,650 --> 00:28:50,620
弗里曼: 这样和古老的外星种族交流
