542
00:29:13,340 --> 00:29:17,410
基本上能够迅速找出我们需要的信息,
and we basically find out any information we want instantly,

543
00:29:17,410 --> 00:29:19,150
也许外星文明
so perhaps an alien civilization

544
00:29:19,150 --> 00:29:21,380
