would have gone further down this road.

545
00:29:21,380 --> 00:29:25,720
我能够想象一个进化方向,
I can imagine evolution taking us in a direction

546
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:29,760
我们越来越不需要脑了,
where less and less is needed of our brains,

547
00:29:29,760 --> 00:29:31,830
我们的生物学脑,
as it were -- of our biology --

548
00:29:31,830 --> 00:29:34,360
因为我们周围建立起的文化系统
because more and more of that is taken on

549
00:29:34,360 --> 00:29:37,530
承担了越来越多的脑力工作,
by the cultural system that we're building around us,

550
00:29:37,530 --> 00:29:42,200
也许我们会在生物学上变得越来越笨,
so perhaps we will get more and more stupid biologically

551
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:46,110
随着时间推移在文化角度越来越聪明。
and more and more smart culturally over time.

552
00:29:46,110 --> 00:29:48,040
弗里曼：无论聪明与否,
Freeman: Clever or not,

553
00:29:48,040 --> 00:29:51,920
外星人需要语言组建文明,
aliens would need language to have civilization.

554
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:55,390
但他们需要讲话吗？
But would they need speech?

555
00:29:55,390 --> 00:29:59,590
如果你能通过心灵感应直接交流思想
Why bother to talk if you can share your thoughts directly

556
00:29:59,590 --> 00:30:02,090
干嘛还要说话呢？
via mental telepathy?

557
00:30:05,030 --> 00:30:07,270
外星人会如何交流?
How might aliens communicate?

558
00:30:07,270 --> 00:30:08,870
我们人类交谈,
We speak.

559
00:30:08,870 --> 00:30:11,170
语言使我们的想法
Language lets us transmit our thoughts

