564
00:30:24,280 --> 00:30:29,220
这可能会发展出一种不同的传输信息的方式,
A different way of transmitting information might evolve.

565
00:30:29,220 --> 00:30:32,520
如果外星人会心灵感应呢？
What if aliens are telepathic?

566
00:30:37,130 --> 00:30:40,900
这在地球上已经发生了,
It's already happening here on earth.

