to determine what it is the person is thinking.

577
00:31:13,930 --> 00:31:16,300
我们接下来就能使用许多方法
We can then send the phrases to some other person

578
00:31:16,300 --> 00:31:18,270
将词语发送到其他人脑中,
using any number of means,

579
00:31:18,270 --> 00:31:20,410
包括电子邮件或短信。
including e-mail or text messaging.

580
00:31:20,410 --> 00:31:23,210
弗里曼：Mike正在测试
Freeman: Mike is testing

581
00:31:23,210 --> 00:31:26,380
这个人在想象两种不同的音节时
whether this man can use the brain waves generated

