587
00:31:40,460 --> 00:31:45,730
如果受试者听到了“Fi”,那他想的就是“Fi”。
if our subject hears "Fi",Then he thinks "Fi".

588
00:31:48,100 --> 00:31:52,570
如果他听到了“Wo”,就会去想“Wo”。
If he hears "Wo",Then he thinks "Wo".

589
00:31:52,570 --> 00:31:53,610
Wo。
wo.

590
00:31:53,610 --> 00:31:56,110
[哔哔响]
[ Beeping ]

591
00:31:56,110 --> 00:31:58,940
“Fi” 在通讯中可以被当做
"Fi" Could be used to communicate

592
00:31:58,940 --> 00:32:02,150
摩尔斯代码的短信号,“Di”。
the short element of morse code,"Di".

593
00:32:02,150 --> 00:32:04,180
“Wo”可以被当做是
"Wo" Can be used to communicate

594
00:32:04,180 --> 00:32:06,820
摩尔斯代码的长信号,“Dah”。
the long element of morse code,"Dah".

595
00:32:09,320 --> 00:32:13,260
弗里曼：这种转换的摩尔斯电码测试非常成功,
