596
00:32:13,260 --> 00:32:18,460
准确率高达100%。
with an accuracy rate near 100%.

597
00:32:18,460 --> 00:32:20,670
这种心灵感应技术
This synthetic telepathy technology

598
00:32:20,670 --> 00:32:25,400
利用了脑中的错误纠正机制。
exploits an error correction mechanism in the brain.

599
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:28,410
当脑向运动皮质发送一个命令时,
When the brain sends a command to the motor cortex,

600
00:32:28,410 --> 00:32:30,810
同时也会产生一个内部效果,
it also creates an internal impression

