00:32:54,970 --> 00:32:57,800
在充满混乱电信号的思维中
Finding and isolating an efference copy

610
00:32:57,800 --> 00:33:00,000
寻找分离出某个传出复制
in the electrical jumble of the mind

611
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:02,010
